1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,817
The classic slip: saying both temperatures depend on the cold junction.

2
00:00:04,817 --> 00:00:07,109
Only the inversion temperature does.

3
00:00:07,109 --> 00:00:16,002
Raise the cold junction by ten degrees, and theta i falls by ten degrees, while theta n does not move at all.

